---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="A-Level Mathematics Formula Sheet | Pure & Mechanics"
  description="Complete A-Level Mathematics formula sheet with pure maths and mechanics formulas. Free download for A-Level students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>A-Level Mathematics<br><span>Formula Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Pure maths and mechanics formulas. From algebra to calculus and beyond.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Pure Mathematics</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Algebra</h3>
        <pre><code>(a+b)² = a² + 2ab + b²
(a-b)² = a² - 2ab + b²
a² - b² = (a+b)(a-b)
logₐ(b) = ln(b)/ln(a)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Trigonometry</h3>
        <pre><code>sin²θ + cos²θ = 1
tanθ = sinθ/cosθ
sin(A±B) = sinAcosB ± cosAsinB
cos(A±B) = cosAcosB ∓ sinAsinB</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Calculus</h3>
        <pre><code>d/dx [xⁿ] = nxⁿ⁻¹
∫ xⁿ dx = xⁿ⁺¹/(n+1) + C
d/dx [eˣ] = eˣ
∫ eˣ dx = eˣ + C</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Mechanics</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Kinematics</h3>
        <pre><code>v = u + at
s = ut + ½at²
v² = u² + 2as
s = ½(u + v)t</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Forces</h3>
        <pre><code>F = ma
W = mg
F = kx (Hooke's law)
p = mv (momentum)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Energy</h3>
        <pre><code>KE = ½mv²
PE = mgh
Work = Fd cos θ
Power = W/t = Fv</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
